&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693" style="color: #fff; background: #e74c3c; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); display: inline-block;"&gt;前往查看详情&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章 给我干哪来了，这还是国内吗&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章 冰霜仙子的贴心照顾&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章 于极寒冰原捡漏带回异乡俊俏凡人不仅贴身焐被窝更是挥金如土逛 大集买衣置物最终竟豪掷千金请动化神期肥美女师尊亲自下场推拿搓澡洗去一身 浊气的冰霜仙子当真豪横！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章 丰乳肥臀化神期老祖搓澡洗髓竟发现凡间小子天赋异禀阳根雄伟暗 含双修奇体于是师徒二人传音密谋一唱一和连哄带骗将人拐进山门还要认干妈&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章 银发仙子独舞月下裙裾翻飞身段如诗偏偏张嘴就是大碴子味儿直教 穿越小子心里又美又堵得慌&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第六章 仙气飘飘凌霄宗门实则屯子里头一群丰腴老娘们儿盘腿坐炕上嗑着 瓜子把穿越来的俊俏小子从头到脚品了个遍恨不得一人掰一块儿带回家&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第七章 跟话痨宗主拉着手好好唠唠嗑&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第八章 回自个窝,正式引气入体&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第九章 师姐开心的抱着睡,奶头子总是往嘴里钻&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十章 不是师父说你，你怎么还没得吃上？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十一章 灵果烧刀子灌了七碗下去银发仙子话匣子炸了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十二章 银发师姐头回嗦就磕了牙干妈叹口气撸袖子亲自上阵&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十三章 师徒俩醉倒在炕上干妈收拾残局瞅见那根还在滴答的东西没忍住又 嗦了一嘴&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十四章 事儿是我办的，以后我罩着你——这话不该是男的来说吗？！！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十五章 走 上江上去&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/16" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十六章 手冷就大大方方揉奶子热乎一下呗但被白发巨乳仙子一边亲一边撸管还坏心眼的根据反应调整节奏是真受不了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/17" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十七章 弗雷尔卓德仙子跪下来把长发扎成马尾低头就是嗦&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/18" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十八章 熟腻美仙子把鸡吧嗦的干干净净一滴都不剩还坏心眼地想要亲嘴？ 结果实际上全程都被干妈一边自慰一边看着？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/19" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十九章 早上起来还整冰火两重天这活儿&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/20" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十章 雪娇闭关修炼 干妈趁虚而入&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/21" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十一章 跟丰腴黑丝熟妇跳踏灵舞？周遭老娘们的视线都不对劲！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/22" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十二章 南方人没吃过的枪弹炮&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/23" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十三章 咱们雪域三省一家人都是睡一个炕上的！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/24" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十四章 小伙子还挺能忍，那就别怪干妈忽悠你走火入魔了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/25" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十五章 颠龙倒凤 话这么多，就别怪拿老娘的大屁股堵住你的嘴了❤&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/26" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十六章 这枪弹炮真妹白吃哈&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/27" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十七章 你看老娘除了屁股比你雪娇姐大，要不要再试试干妈的大奶子❤&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/28" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十八章 这么爽必须留影石给你照上❤以后还不是得听我的&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/29" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十九章 炼体效果斐然，文弱小伙变壮实小猛男，再临大澡堂子洗髓突破&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/30" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十章 天道完美筑基，雪娇姐终要出关&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/31" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十一章 师父嗦了一冬的鸡巴，今儿总算得还给原配了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/32" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十二章 小别胜新婚，大鸡巴吓退金丹魂&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/33" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十三章 姐今儿非得把你这大棒槌给降伏了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/34" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十四章 姐这金丹底子，还怕榨不干你这大棒槌？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/35" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十五章 姐这三百年的黄花地，让你一宿翻个底朝天&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/36" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十六章 姐这地儿叫你翻了个遍，出门都自带春风&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/37" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十七章 干妈这骚逼憋了八天，再不开荤得上火&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/38" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十八章 干妈带你钻苞米地，让你尝尝化神期的无底洞&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/6595b9dc69904e07a6d454c65d5d3693/reader/39" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十九章 苞米地里开了荤，干妈这老逼总算吃着肉了&lt;/a&gt;
